  "description": "Kang Tae-Hwa’s first crush came to him like a fever. And ten years later, that fever is still running high when he reunites with his once privileged and untouchable love, Moon Cheong-Hyeon. But the tables have turned now, as Tae-Hwa has gone from being a poor street kid to the gangster boss of his own money-lending business, and Cheong-Hyeon is his latest customer. Cheong-Hyeon knows the violent and foulmouthed Tae-Hwa is no good for him, but he is drawn back to him anyway. And hearing this, Tae-Hwa becomes determined not to lose his first love a second time... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
